items.description:
I found Rocket League pros who were live on twitch and gave them a seemingly possible task of beating an easy training pack. In reality, this pack is the hardest in the game and basically impossible to fully complete within the timer. If they manage to beat the pack by some miracle, I’ll give them $100 straight up. Let’s see who’s really the ultimate rocket league pro.


Big ups to those featured in the video. Highly recommend checking them out:
@Retals @Wahvey_RL @arsenalrl7550 @FlitzRL @Jamaic
